Model weights
========================================================================

Model weights (GGUF files) are NOT redistributed with this software.
They are downloaded by the end user at first container run from Hugging Face
Hub under each model's own license (typically Apache-2.0 for Mistral,
Qwen2.5, and DeepSeek distill variants listed in models.toml).
